        "text": "A minimum of 64 semester or 96 quarter units of undergraduate courses is required\nOf the required 64 (96 quarter) units, 24 (36 quarter) units must be non-science undergraduate courses. These may include Pacific CORE and non-science Breadth Program courses in addition to other non-science courses\n2.0 GPA from these units is required to count towards the degree",
